<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Rain, dew, abundant showers,</l><l>Snow, cleansing, with the power</l><l>To remedy the ache of secret grief.</l><l>Hammer and burning fire,</l><l>Smash Satan, he’s a liar,</l><l>Break strongholds,</l><l>Melt your icy heart, most cold.</l><l>Meet Me in the Word, child,</l><l>And linger for a while;</l><l>Sweet honey for the bitter</l><l>Environments that defile</l><l>Your standing as my treasure;</l><l>My word will purify:</l><l>Dividing soul from spirit, so</l><l>That by the word you’ll grow.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
